# The repository root .gitignore has a blanket `data/` rule for pipeline test
# data, which would otherwise swallow this package's threshold YAMLs. They are
# declared package-data and must ship inside the wheel, so re-include them.
!src/spatialqc/data/
!src/spatialqc/data/*.yaml
